###################################################################
#
# rlsw.eng  -  Class rlsw english text description file  
#
# $Revision: 1.4 $
#
# DESCRIPTION:
#
#  ReaL text description file
# 
# DEFINITION AND TRANSLATION RULES
# 
# This file refer to following type of top object in the Robust (ARL)
# Reference Manual: INSTRUCTION, FUNCTION or DATA TYPE
#
# Following general rules for ARL Identifiers must applies for translation to
# native language of all text objects:
# - Maximum general length of text object 16 characters
# - Characters means letters, digits or underscore _ (According ISO 8859-1)
# - The first character in an text object must be a letter
# - All characters are significant
# - Text object differing only in the use of corresponding upper and lower
#   case letters are considered the same
#
# Type of text objects to translate:
# (1) Name of INSTRUCTION:
#     - Max. 9 characters (Instruction Plock List) 
#     - Upper case letter for the first letter in one word. The rest of the word
#       in lower case letters. Normal abbreviation of several words.
#     - E.g. MoveL for Move Linear
# (2) Name of FUNCTION:
#     - Max. 9 characters. (Instruction Plock List)
#       Need for shorter for expression context.
#     - Upper case letter for the first letter in the word. The rest of the word
#       in lower case letters. Normal abbreviation of several words.
#     - E.g. ReadNum for Read Numerical
# 
# (3) Name of REQUIRED PARAMETER:
#     - Max. 12 characters (Instruction Form)
#     - Upper case letter for the first letter in the word. The rest of the word
#       in lower case letters.
#     - E.g. Speed
#
# (4) Name of OPTION PARAMETER:
#     - Must be short (in the program list)
#     - Upper case letter for the first letter in the word. The rest of the word
#       in lower case letters.
#     - E.g. WObj for Work Object
#
# (5) Name of SWITCH PARAMETER:
#     - Must be short (in the program list)
#     - Upper case letter for the first letter in the word. The rest of the word
#       in lower case letters.
#     - E.g. Conc for Concurrent
#
# (6) Name of DATA TYPE:
#     - Can be fairly long (not in the visible program list)
#     - Only lower case letters
#     - E.g. robtarget for robot target
#
# (7) Name of DATA COMPONENT:
#     - Must be short (in the program list)
#     - Only lower case letters
#     - E.g. robconf for robot configuration
#
# MODIFICATIONS:
#
